<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The deficit created by large subscription to the tap issue of seven year stock, which resulted in call rates hardening to near 10 percent, has been wiped out by the reversal of 49,000 million rupees at the 28th June repo auction. Hence the first fortnight of July begins with a square position, and the extent of surplus liquidity will be largely decided by the subscription amounts at repos.</p>
